If you don't have insurance, 
I'm gonna rip your balls off.

137
00:25:19,017 --> 00:25:19,776
- I don't want any problems, okay? 
- Shut up!

138
00:25:19,776 --> 00:25:21,276
[Edit: Cemetery caretaker / company-car rant]

139
