[Edit: Post-knockout check]

156
00:31:49,324 --> 00:31:52,869
Sarah Connor? Blowing up Cyberdyne?

157
00:31:53,119 --> 00:31:56,414
"Hasta la vista, baby. " 
Ring any bells?

158
00:31:56,581 --> 00:31:59,083
That was a different T-101.

159
